// BT-3047 / ADR 0109 amendment: ancestor fixture for the inherited-self-send-
// inside-a-foreign-block tests (stdlib/test/class_method_block_self_identity_test.bt).
// `foo` is defined only here — BT3047Parent (fixtures/bt3047parent.bt)
// inherits it without overriding, so `self foo` inside a block that BT3047Parent
// hands to another class's block-taking method must still resolve against
// this ancestor chain, not whichever class's process happens to run the block.

Value subclass: BT3047Ancestor

  class foo -> Symbol => #FromAncestor
